                                "sense_id": "069a97e0-7877-3cde-b5ae-dcb8effb2171",
                                "text": "The large crop of independents, emerging, at all events, as queerers of the democratic pitch, are evidence of the deeper cuts […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cbf7e068-b81a-48fa-8460-28ecb9576208",
                                "sense_id": "069a97e0-7877-3cde-b5ae-dcb8effb2171",
                                "text": "The people spoke and grew queerer “as the Spirit gave them ability” (Acts 2:4). God is the Queer doing the queering. God is the one pulling the tongues out of the people. God is the great queerer of every moment."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
